l. warm-up. GridView.builder 10 columns x 128 px; scroll = triangle wave over the grid at 3000 px/s; zoom 1->3->1 over 6 s (Transform) with a sinusoidal pan; during warm-up the script is frozen at t=0.","unsupported":null}